│         █                                                                              █         │
│         █  • j / k move one line and stop at either end of the file; they never        █         │
│         █    wrap around.                                                              █         │
│         █  • G jumps to the last line and g to the first.                              █         │
│         █  • J / K move by hunk, and stop at the first and the last hunk.              █k` to m  │
└─────────█  • The arrow keys do the same as j and k, and page up and page down move     █       ▇▇│
┌─ [2] Pul█    by a screen.                                                          ▄▄  █         │
